      "cwe": "CWE-476",
      "class": "ClassPathResource",
      "method": "equals",
      "explanation": "The equals method invokes this.classLoader.equals(...) and this.clazz.equals(...) without null checks. The classLoader field can be null when set via the protected constructor, and the clazz field is null by default. This can lead to a NullPointerException when ClassPathResource instances are used in collections or compared, resulting in denial of service."
    }
  ]
